  "description": "Just as I was getting used to a novel where I’d been possessed by an unstoppable will to survive, an unusual little kid rolled into my life. It was hard enough just to make ends meet, but I couldn’t turn away from those cute little eyes, so I raised him with all my care. \n\n*“I’m going to marry you. Sign the marriage registration form for me.”\n\n“Later, later~ If you still feel the same way when you’re all grown up, then write your name down.”*\n\nSince minors aren’t even eligible to file, I just signed it as a joke, but they say the marriage registration was accepted? And on top of that, the true identity of the little one in my house… is the Emperor?! I got tricked by the scheming male lead’s disguise and ended up getting married!\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
